	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Community Groups]]></title>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each card below is rendered by the <strong>BP Groups List</strong> block. Inside it, the Groups Cover Image, Groups Heading and Groups Description variations, the Group Contributors block and the Progress Bar block all read the current group. Select <em>View All</em> to reveal every member, or open a group to see the Progress Bar and Group Contributors blocks on its BuddyPress page.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

